Z||000000||Motorhead||05-21-99||08:47 PM||||Anybody know why my right headlight only goes halfway up with the hood closed, but when I raise the hood for closer inspection the stupid thing goes all the way up.  It's like it's got a mind of it's own, and just does this to torment me! <p>With the hood up it goes up and down all day, but close the lid, and the car gives a half ass wink.<p>By the way, looked at an '87 GT today.  Great price. Do I really want two of these cars? JUST KIDDING,  can't wait to bring it home!   <br>
